1
00:00:05,430 --> 00:00:10,030
Hey,you guys ever wonder why they call it "Thanksgiving"?
你們有想過 為什麼要叫感恩節嗎？

2
00:00:12,010 --> 00:00:16,140
Okay. Hey,Monica,you're doing Thanksgiving next week,right?
好，摩妮卡 你下星期要煮感恩節大餐吧？

3
00:00:16,310 --> 00:00:19,510
Because Carol's taking Ben to her parents' place in Florida.
卡蘿要帶班去佛州看她父母

4
00:00:19,680 --> 00:00:23,240
Okay,okay. I'll make Thanksgiving dinner.
好好好，我來煮

5
00:00:23,420 --> 00:00:25,410
You don't have to beg.
你不必求我

6
00:00:25,590 --> 00:00:27,580
I didn't beg. I just asked once.
我沒有求你，我只是問你

7
00:00:28,560 --> 00:00:30,750
You could beg,you know.
求一下又不會死

8
00:00:30,930 --> 00:00:33,330
Monica said I could make dessert this year.
摩妮卡說我今年可以做甜點

9
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:35,990
-You're gonna cook something? -Hey,I cook.
你要下廚？ 我會下廚啊

10
00:00:36,160 --> 00:00:39,190
Offering people gum is not cooking.
拿口香糖給別人不叫下廚

11
00:00:39,830 --> 00:00:42,270
Are you sure Monica said you could cook this year?
摩妮卡真的是說今年嗎？

12
00:00:42,440 --> 00:00:45,630
I remember her saying in two years. You said in two years,right?
我記得她是說後年 你是說後年吧？

13
00:00:46,370 --> 00:00:48,270
No,I promised her.
我已經答應她了

14
00:00:48,440 --> 00:00:52,310
Are you sure you want to start out with something as big as Thanksgiving dinner?
你確定要一出手 就做感恩節甜點？

15
00:00:52,480 --> 00:00:55,640
I mean,maybe you wanna try a little Thanksgiving breakfast?
要不要先做感恩節早餐？ 

16
00:00:55,820 --> 00:00:58,180
Maybe a Thanksgiving snack?
或是感恩節零食？

17
00:00:58,350 --> 00:01:00,290
Come on,you guys, I can do this.
別這樣，我一定行 

18
00:01:00,460 --> 00:01:02,620
Remember,I made those peanut butter cookies.
我不是做過花生醬餅乾？

19
00:01:06,490 --> 00:01:08,990
What are you guys so worried about? Cooking is easy.
你們在擔心什麼 煮菜很簡單

20
00:01:09,160 --> 00:01:10,720
You just follow the recipe.
照食譜就對了

21
00:01:10,900 --> 00:01:14,930
If it says,"boil two cups of salt," you just boil two cups of salt.
如果食譜說「將兩杯鹽煮沸」 你就把兩杯鹽煮沸

22
00:01:17,140 --> 00:01:19,110
The One Where Ross Got High
本集播出：「感恩的季節」

23
00:01:21,548 --> 00:01:22,247
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

24
00:01:55,080 --> 00:01:57,070
Okay,great. Bye.
太好了，再見

25
00:01:58,210 --> 00:02:00,040
Guess who's coming to Thanksgiving dinner?
你猜誰要來吃感恩節晚餐？

26
00:02:00,250 --> 00:02:01,910
Sidney Poitier?
薜尼鮑迪？ （曾主演「誰來晚餐」）

27
00:02:03,020 --> 00:02:04,580
I miss Rachel.
我懷念瑞秋

28
00:02:05,350 --> 00:02:06,340
My parents.
是我爸媽

29
00:02:06,520 --> 00:02:08,920
Great, they haven't seen the place since I moved in.
太好了，我搬進來之後 他們還沒來過

30
00:02:09,190 --> 00:02:12,520
If you could not mention that we live together, that'd be great.
對，要是你能不提同居的事 就太好了

31
00:02:12,760 --> 00:02:15,020
I was thinking we'd eat around 4.
我打算4點左右開動

32
00:02:15,600 --> 00:02:17,530
Why can't I tell them we live together?
為什麼不能提同居的事？

33
00:02:17,770 --> 00:02:20,630
They don't know we're dating. Should we eat in the kitchen?
因為他們不知道我們在交往 要在廚房吃嗎？

34
00:02:21,370 --> 00:02:22,730
Why haven't you told them?
你為什麼沒有告訴他們？

35
00:02:22,970 --> 00:02:25,700
Well,I was going to. I really was.
我本來要說，真的

36
00:02:25,970 --> 00:02:29,100
But then somewhere, just out of nowhere,I didn't.
但是後來不知怎的就沒說了

37
00:02:30,450 --> 00:02:32,540
Why not? Wouldn't they be happy?
你為什麼沒說？ 他們不會開心嗎？

38
00:02:32,780 --> 00:02:36,080
So,dinner in the kitchen around 4. I'll see you then.
4點左右廚房開動，到時候見

39
00:02:36,280 --> 00:02:37,770
Why wouldn't they be happy?
他們為什麼不會開心？

40
00:02:38,050 --> 00:02:39,610
Well,because...
因為…

41
00:02:40,420 --> 00:02:41,720
mainly...
主要是

42
00:02:43,060 --> 00:02:44,890
they don't like you.
他們不喜歡你

43
00:02:45,130 --> 00:02:47,490
-I'm sorry. -What? Why? Why?
對不起 什麼？為什麼？

44
00:02:48,160 --> 00:02:50,190
Maybe because you used to be aloof...
也許是因為你以前很冷漠

45
00:02:50,400 --> 00:02:53,460
or that you're sarcastic or that you joke around...
很尖酸刻薄，老愛開玩笑

46
00:02:53,670 --> 00:02:56,430
or that you throw your clothes on the couch.
或許是因為你脫了衣服都亂丟

47
00:02:56,640 --> 00:02:59,130
Is this why they don't like me or you don't like me?
這是他們的還是你的看法

48
00:03:00,510 --> 00:03:03,810
I know I should have told them. I shouldn't care what they think.
我知道我應該告訴他們 我不該在意他們

49
00:03:04,010 --> 00:03:05,000
I'm sorry.
對不起

50
00:03:06,850 --> 00:03:10,310
It'll be okay because when they come over, I will be charming.
其實沒關係，等他們來了 我會表現得很迷人

51
00:03:10,590 --> 00:03:13,150
I will make them love me, then we'll tell them.
我會讓他們愛上我 然後我們再說

52
00:03:13,350 --> 00:03:14,450
Will that work?
你真的覺得可行？

53
00:03:14,690 --> 00:03:18,130
I can be pretty charming,babe. I won you over, didn't l?
我也可以很有魅力 我不就贏得了你的心？

54
00:03:19,360 --> 00:03:21,950
I don't think you'll ever get my parents that drunk.
你應該不能把他們灌到那麼醉

55
00:03:26,500 --> 00:03:29,440
Hey. Oh, good,Ross. Your parents like me, right?
太好了，羅斯 你爸媽喜歡我，對吧？

56
00:03:29,700 --> 00:03:31,600
Yes, of course they like you.
他們當然喜歡你

57
00:03:31,870 --> 00:03:33,310
Monica told me they don't.
摩妮卡說他們不喜歡我

58
00:03:33,510 --> 00:03:35,170
Yeah,they don't like you.
對，他們不喜歡你

59
00:03:36,340 --> 00:03:37,330
Do you know why?
你知道原因嗎？

60
00:03:37,510 --> 00:03:41,450
Maybe it's because you're sarcastic or maybe it's because you..
也許是因為你很尖酸刻薄 或者是因為…

61
00:03:41,880 --> 00:03:44,650
If people don't know, they shouldn't just guess!
不知道就不要亂猜

62
00:03:45,720 --> 00:03:48,450
Another Thanksgiving with nothing to give thanks for.
帥啊 又一個不值得感恩的感恩節

63
00:03:48,660 --> 00:03:51,560
Maybe I give thanks for you shutting up,huh?
也許我可以感恩你閉嘴

64
00:03:52,860 --> 00:03:55,830
Maybe I give thanks by taking my PlayStation to my place.
也許我可以感恩你把我的電動 送去我的新家

65
00:03:56,030 --> 00:03:57,860
Maybe I love you.
也許我愛你

66
00:04:00,870 --> 00:04:02,270
Hey,guys.
你們好

67
00:04:02,470 --> 00:04:06,000
No,I don't want to play video games, Joey!
不要，我不想打電動

68
00:04:08,810 --> 00:04:11,280
Are you guys going to Chandler's for Thanksgiving?
你們要去錢德家過感恩節嗎？

69
00:04:11,450 --> 00:04:12,440
Yeah,why?
對，怎麼了？

70
00:04:12,610 --> 00:04:15,140
Me and my friends are doing Thanksgiving uptown.
我和幾個舞者朋友想一起慶祝 

71
00:04:15,420 --> 00:04:17,210
I thought you might like to come.
我想說你們可能想去

72
00:04:17,490 --> 00:04:19,080
For real?
真的去？

73
00:04:20,090 --> 00:04:22,780
You should go to Chandler's. None of us can cook.
你們是該去錢德家 我們沒有人會做菜

74
00:04:23,060 --> 00:04:24,460
We'll just drink all day.
最後八成都在喝酒

75
00:04:24,690 --> 00:04:26,520
We go to yours!
好，我們去

76
00:04:28,030 --> 00:04:32,060
We have to stop across the hall because it's my sister.
對，我們得過去露個面 畢竟她是我妹妹

77
00:04:32,300 --> 00:04:35,530
But,you know,actually, growing up with a sister was nice...
不過有個妹妹是好事 

78
00:04:35,770 --> 00:04:38,030
because it helped me understand women.
讓我很瞭解女人心

79
00:04:38,310 --> 00:04:40,900
Yeah, you should tell your friends that.
你應該告訴她們

80
00:04:41,910 --> 00:04:43,000
Okay.
好

81
00:04:47,680 --> 00:04:51,120
How you got three women to marry you, I'll never know.
真不知你怎麼能騙到三個老婆

82
00:04:55,620 --> 00:04:58,590
Hey,Mon,look. I'm melting butter.
摩妮卡，你看，我在融化奶油

83
00:04:59,960 --> 00:05:03,760
That's great,Rach. You now have the cooking skills of a hot day.
太好了，跟天氣熱的效果一樣

84
00:05:07,240 --> 00:05:09,500
Phoebe,check it out! For my dessert...
菲比，你看，感恩節甜點 

85
00:05:09,670 --> 00:05:12,230
I'm making a traditional English trifle.
我決定做酒果醬鬆糕

86
00:05:12,440 --> 00:05:16,210
Wow. That sounds great! And what are you making,Monica?
聽起來好棒 摩妮卡你呢？

88
00:05:16,410 --> 00:05:19,540
In case Rachel's dessert is so good that I eat all of it...
萬一瑞秋的甜點 好吃到被我吃光光

89
00:05:21,580 --> 00:05:23,980
and there's none left for anybody else!
別人會沒得吃

90
00:05:25,390 --> 00:05:26,410
Nothing.
我不做 

91
00:05:26,650 --> 00:05:27,780
Nothing?
你不做？

92
00:05:28,390 --> 00:05:30,410
No,sweetie. I trust you.
對，我信任你

93
00:05:31,090 --> 00:05:33,960
If I mess this up, there's nothing else for dessert?
所以要是我搞砸 就沒有甜點了？

94
00:05:34,760 --> 00:05:36,290
You won't mess it up.
你不會搞砸的

95
00:05:36,730 --> 00:05:40,390
I love that. You really have faith in me. Thank you.
摩妮卡，我好高興 你真的對我有信心，謝謝

96
00:05:40,600 --> 00:05:43,590
Question: How do you know when the butter is done?
技術問題 這些奶油什麼時候好？

97
00:05:43,870 --> 00:05:47,100
It's done about two minutes before it looks like that.
大約變成這樣2分鐘前

98
00:05:52,450 --> 00:05:56,140
-The food smells great, Mon. -And the place looks so nice.
菜聞起來好香 這裡佈置得真漂亮

100
00:05:56,420 --> 00:06:01,480
-Hey,happy Thanksgiving,everybody! -Happy Thanksgiving!
感恩節快樂

101
00:06:01,690 --> 00:06:04,390
-Well,this has been great. -See you.
真是開心 再見

102
00:06:04,590 --> 00:06:05,620
Whoa,whoa,whoa!

103
00:06:07,130 --> 00:06:08,720
Where you going?
你們要去哪裡？

104
00:06:08,930 --> 00:06:12,870
We did say we'd stop by this little thing Joey's roommate is having.
我們說過要去參加 喬伊的室友的聚會

105
00:06:13,230 --> 00:06:15,600
Oh,Janine, the really hot dancer girl?
火辣舞者吉寧？

106
00:06:16,200 --> 00:06:19,540
Some would say she's attractive,yes.
有些人會說她很有魅力

107
00:06:19,940 --> 00:06:21,910
Who else is going to be there?
還有誰會去？

108
00:06:22,080 --> 00:06:23,130
Her friends.
她的幾個朋友

109
00:06:23,310 --> 00:06:24,440
Her dancer friends?
舞者朋友？

110
00:06:24,610 --> 00:06:26,310
Yes! All right?
對啦，好不好？

111
00:06:26,480 --> 00:06:29,510
All of her hot dancer friends are gonna be there...
她的性感舞者朋友都會去

112
00:06:29,780 --> 00:06:33,380
and they'll be drinking and dancing and we really want to go!
她們會喝酒跳舞 我們真的很想去

113
00:06:35,590 --> 00:06:37,560
Dude,we were good.
都快成功了

114
00:06:38,490 --> 00:06:41,760
You're not going. You said you'd eat here and you'll eat here.
你們哪兒也不准去 你們說要來吃飯就別想跑

115
00:06:41,960 --> 00:06:44,930
Yeah,and leaving us to go see hot dancer girls...
扔下我們去看性感舞者 

116
00:06:45,130 --> 00:06:47,100
is not very Thanksgiving-y.
可不太感恩

117
00:06:47,540 --> 00:06:48,900
Oh,but it is.
但是...

118
00:06:49,100 --> 00:06:53,540
It's like the first Thanksgiving when the Indians and Pilgrims sat down.
第一個感恩節就是這樣 印地安人和清教徒共進晚餐

120
00:06:53,780 --> 00:06:56,210
Then the Indians taught the Pilgrims...
然後印地安人告訴清教徒 

121
00:06:56,410 --> 00:06:58,680
...what it meant to be hot in the New World!
新世界的性感定義是什麼

122
00:07:00,650 --> 00:07:02,880
Fellas,I really think you should stay here.
我真的覺得你們應該留下來

123
00:07:03,050 --> 00:07:05,310
You're just jealous because you can't go.
你不能去就嫉妒

124
00:07:06,390 --> 00:07:08,910
That is so not true.
沒有這回事

125
00:07:13,060 --> 00:07:14,760
-Hello,everybody! -Hi!
大家好

126
00:07:16,700 --> 00:07:19,000
Hi,Dad. Mom.
爸，媽

127
00:07:19,330 --> 00:07:22,230
Look! Look who it is! It's Chandler!
看，是錢德耶

128
00:07:23,670 --> 00:07:26,270
Oh,yes,of course. Hello,Chandler.
錢德，你好

129
00:07:26,940 --> 00:07:29,000
Mr. and Mrs. Geller, you look wonderful.
伯父伯母，你們的氣色真好 

130
00:07:29,240 --> 00:07:31,970
It is great to have you here. Let us take your coats.
歡迎，外套給我們吧

131
00:07:32,450 --> 00:07:34,850
Whoa,it snowing out there?
外面在下雪嗎？

132
00:07:35,920 --> 00:07:36,940
No.
沒有

133
00:07:44,290 --> 00:07:46,350
Monica,all this food looks wonderful.
摩妮卡，菜看起來都好好吃 

134
00:07:46,560 --> 00:07:48,390
You should do this for a living.
你應該考慮走這一行

135
00:07:51,470 --> 00:07:55,900
Okay,I have dandruff. There's no need to laugh and point.
就算我有頭皮屑 你也不必指著我笑

136
00:07:57,710 --> 00:07:59,700
Chandler was laughing at your joke.
爸，錢德是在笑你的笑話

137
00:07:59,910 --> 00:08:01,570
My joke wasn't funny.
我的笑話又不好笑

138
00:08:03,040 --> 00:08:04,710
Chandler laughs at everything.
錢德什麼事都笑 

139
00:08:04,880 --> 00:08:07,180
That's one of the great things about him.
那是他的優點之一

140
00:08:10,380 --> 00:08:12,510
Rach,I just remembered.
瑞秋，我剛剛想到

141
00:08:12,720 --> 00:08:14,850
I had a dream about Mr. Geller last night.
我昨晚夢到蓋勒先生 

142
00:08:15,060 --> 00:08:15,920
Really?
真的嗎？

143
00:08:16,190 --> 00:08:19,020
I dreamt that he saved me from a burning building...
對，我夢到他把我從火場救出 

144
00:08:19,330 --> 00:08:21,320
and he was so brave and so strong.
他好英勇好強壯

145
00:08:21,560 --> 00:08:24,360
And it's making me look at him totally differently.
我對他完全改觀

146
00:08:26,270 --> 00:08:29,730
He used to be just "Jack Geller,Monica and Ross' dad."
他以前只是傑克蓋勒 摩妮卡和羅斯的爸爸

147
00:08:29,970 --> 00:08:33,270
Now he's "Jack Geller,dream hunk."
現在他是傑克蓋勒，夢中情人

148
00:08:36,640 --> 00:08:39,610
I don't know. To me, he'll always be "Jack Geller...
不知道耶 對我來說他永遠都是傑克蓋勒

149
00:08:39,810 --> 00:08:42,080
walks in while you're changing."
在你換衣服時闖進來

150
00:08:45,550 --> 00:08:49,350
You know,Dad,Chandler is one of Ross' very best friends.
爸 錢德是羅斯最要好的朋友之一

151
00:08:49,520 --> 00:08:50,890
Yes,I know.
是，我知道

152
00:08:51,760 --> 00:08:53,450
Ross sure is a great guy.
羅斯是個好青年

153
00:08:53,690 --> 00:08:56,690
I've always felt that how a man turns out...
我一直覺得兒子...

154
00:08:57,000 --> 00:08:58,690
is a reflection on his father.
是父親的翻版

155
00:08:58,970 --> 00:09:02,490
I always thought that too. Tell me, what does your father do?
我也有同感 請問你爸是做什麼的？

156
00:09:05,040 --> 00:09:07,060
He's a headliner of a...
他是...

157
00:09:07,310 --> 00:09:09,140
gay burlesque show.
同志歌舞秀的頭牌

158
00:09:11,950 --> 00:09:14,810
You're killing us. Will you serve the dessert already?
瑞秋你急死人了，快上甜點啦

159
00:09:15,020 --> 00:09:17,610
There's drunken dancers a-waiting!
有酒醉的舞者都在等我們

160
00:09:18,190 --> 00:09:19,910
Look at it. Isn't it beautiful?
你們看，很漂亮吧？

161
00:09:20,120 --> 00:09:21,450
Yeah. What is it?
是啊，這是什麼？

162
00:09:21,720 --> 00:09:23,950
It's a trifle. It's got all these layers.
酒果醬鬆糕，有很多層

163
00:09:24,260 --> 00:09:27,390
First there's a layer of ladyfingers,then jam...
先是一層小鬆糕，然後是果醬

164
00:09:27,630 --> 00:09:31,330
then custard, which I made from scratch...
然後是我自己做的乳蛋糕

165
00:09:31,530 --> 00:09:33,400
then raspberries, more ladyfingers...
然後是覆盆子 然後又是小鬆糕

166
00:09:33,600 --> 00:09:35,660
then beef sauteed with peas and onions...
然後是豌豆洋蔥炒嫩牛肉

167
00:09:36,040 --> 00:09:38,470
then a little bit more custard...
然後又有一點乳蛋糕

168
00:09:39,370 --> 00:09:42,140
then bananas and then I put whipped cream on top.
然後是香蕉 最後再塗上鮮奶油

169
00:09:46,910 --> 00:09:49,640
What was the one right before bananas?
香蕉前面是什麼？

170
00:09:52,050 --> 00:09:54,890
The beef. Yeah,that was weird to me too.
炒牛肉嗎？我也覺得有點奇怪

171
00:09:55,160 --> 00:09:58,390
But then I thought, "Well,there's minced-meat pie."
不過我想說連甜肉餡餅都有了 

172
00:09:58,590 --> 00:10:00,150
That's an English dessert.
那是一種英式甜點

173
00:10:00,360 --> 00:10:03,660
These people just put strange things in their food.
英國人都放一堆怪東西

174
00:10:03,860 --> 00:10:05,990
Can I borrow rum from your place?
對了，可以跟你借蘭姆酒嗎？ 

175
00:10:06,170 --> 00:10:07,360
Yeah,sure.
當然可以

176
00:10:07,540 --> 00:10:09,730
While I'm gone, don't you sneak a taste.
我不在的時候你們可別偷吃

177
00:10:14,480 --> 00:10:16,770
Beef in a dessert?
甜點加牛肉？

178
00:10:17,280 --> 00:10:19,270
No,no,no. There is no way.
不可能的

179
00:10:19,480 --> 00:10:22,640
I know. And only one layer of jam?
就是啊，而且果醬才一層

180
00:10:25,590 --> 00:10:27,990
What is up with that?
有沒有搞錯？

181
00:10:29,560 --> 00:10:31,150
Oh,my God.
天哪

182
00:10:31,390 --> 00:10:33,330
The pages are stuck together.
這兩頁黏在一起

183
00:10:33,560 --> 00:10:35,690
Chandler!
錢德

184
00:10:41,300 --> 00:10:45,830
Oh,my God. She made half an English trifle and...
天哪，她做了酒果醬鬆糕加…

185
00:10:46,840 --> 00:10:49,670
half a shepherd's pie!
肉餡馬鈴薯泥餅

186
00:10:51,510 --> 00:10:53,610
Man,now she's gonna start all over.
完了，她得重做了

187
00:10:53,910 --> 00:10:57,680
We're never gonna get to introduce the hot girls to the New World.
我們沒辦法帶那些辣妹 認識新世界了

188
00:10:57,850 --> 00:11:00,910
No,no,we will. We just won't tell her she messed up.
不，我們可以 不要告訴她就是了

189
00:11:01,190 --> 00:11:03,160
Just let her serve the beef-custard thing?
然後讓她上那個牛肉乳蛋糕？

190
00:11:04,230 --> 00:11:07,190
Yeah. It'll be like a funny Thanksgiving story.
對，這會是個有趣的回憶

191
00:11:07,560 --> 00:11:10,500
Vomiting stories are funny,I guess.
嘔吐的回憶的確很有趣

192
00:11:11,570 --> 00:11:14,690
Joey. God,your apartment is,like,100 degrees.
喬伊，天哪，你家熱死了

193
00:11:14,900 --> 00:11:17,460
Did it make you want to walk around in your underwear?
你會不會想脫到只剩內衣？

194
00:11:18,370 --> 00:11:19,400
No.
不會

195
00:11:19,910 --> 00:11:22,140
Still not hot enough!
還不夠熱

196
00:11:25,080 --> 00:11:27,510
Rachel. Okay,look at him.
瑞秋？ 怎樣？

197
00:11:27,750 --> 00:11:30,080
Look at those strong hands.
你看他，你看那雙有力的手

198
00:11:30,350 --> 00:11:33,910
Oh,what I wouldn't give to be that can of condensed milk.
我真想當那瓶…煉乳

199
00:11:39,060 --> 00:11:41,760
Chandler was just saying how beautiful your sweater is.
媽，錢德說你的毛衣很好看

200
00:11:42,000 --> 00:11:43,660
Thank you. I just bought it.
謝謝你，這是新衣服

201
00:11:43,900 --> 00:11:48,430
Yes,well,it's very beautiful and it's cream-colored and tight and...
是嗎，很漂亮，米色的，很緊

202
00:11:50,840 --> 00:11:54,540
I don't mean tight. It's not tight. Not that I was looking at...
我不是指很緊，不會很緊 我沒有在看…

203
00:11:55,240 --> 00:11:57,300
What's the matter with him?
他是怎麼搞的？

204
00:11:57,510 --> 00:11:59,910
I think he's stoned again.
大概又嗑藥了

205
00:12:01,350 --> 00:12:02,610
What?
什麼？

206
00:12:02,820 --> 00:12:04,310
I need to talk to you.
我有事要告訴你

207
00:12:10,730 --> 00:12:13,690
I think I might know why my parents don't like you.
我大概知道 我爸媽為什麼不喜歡你了

208
00:12:13,890 --> 00:12:14,760
Why?
是嗎？為什麼？

209
00:12:14,960 --> 00:12:17,560
Okay,remember we were young.
記不記得我們年輕的時候

210
00:12:17,930 --> 00:12:21,630
Spring break, sophomore year, I got high in my bedroom...
大二的春假，我在房裡哈麻 

211
00:12:21,900 --> 00:12:24,060
and my parents walked in and smelled it...
我爸媽走進來聞到了

212
00:12:24,310 --> 00:12:28,470
so I told them that you had gotten stoned and jumped out the window.
於是我就說你哈了麻 跳窗走了

213
00:12:29,810 --> 00:12:31,280
Why did you do that?
什麼？你為什麼要賴給我？

214
00:12:31,480 --> 00:12:35,310
I don't know. Yours was the first name that popped into my head.
我不知道，我第一個想到你

215
00:12:35,550 --> 00:12:37,450
I didn't think it'd matter.
對不起，我以為不會怎樣

216
00:12:37,790 --> 00:12:38,770
How could it not matter?
怎麼可能不會怎樣？

217
00:12:39,090 --> 00:12:41,550
How was I to know we'd be friends after college...
我怎麼知道我們會變成死黨 

218
00:12:41,790 --> 00:12:43,780
and you'd be living with my sister?
更別提你會跟我妹同居了

219
00:12:44,060 --> 00:12:45,750
What about the "friends forever" stuff?
那些「生死之交」的豪語呢？

220
00:12:46,190 --> 00:12:48,530
I don't know. I was all high.
不曉得，我當時正high

221
00:12:54,200 --> 00:12:58,900
Mom and Dad sent me to find out if you were trying to get Ross stoned.
爸媽叫我來看看 你是不是想找羅斯嗑藥

222
00:13:00,240 --> 00:13:04,370
Your parents caught Ross smoking pot in college,and he blamed it on me!
羅斯大學哈麻被他們逮到 他居然賴給我

223
00:13:04,750 --> 00:13:06,180
I can't believe you!
羅斯，你怎麼這樣

224
00:13:06,450 --> 00:13:10,910
We haven't told them we're together because they hate me, so fix this.
他們討厭我，我們才沒公開

225
00:13:11,120 --> 00:13:15,110
Okay, okay, I'll tell them it wasn't Chandler who got high.
好啦，我會說哈麻的不是錢德

227
00:13:15,360 --> 00:13:17,880
Now, who should I say it was?
那我要說是誰？

228
00:13:18,530 --> 00:13:23,290
You! It's not like it's a big deal. You don't still do it or anything.
你！這又沒什麼 你現在又沒在嗑藥

229
00:13:23,530 --> 00:13:27,870
All right. Now,who should I say tricked me into doing it?
好啦好啦 那我要說是誰騙我這麼做的？

230
00:13:28,470 --> 00:13:31,910
Nobody. You're gonna go out there and tell them exactly what happened.
沒有人，你要跟他們說實話

231
00:13:32,070 --> 00:13:33,870
-Really? -Yes!
是嗎？ 對

232
00:13:34,780 --> 00:13:36,110
Okay.
好吧

233
00:13:36,280 --> 00:13:38,340
Wait,is there anything else I should know?
等等，還有別的事嗎？ 

234
00:13:38,510 --> 00:13:41,240
No.. Oh,yeah....
沒了…喔有…

235
00:13:42,150 --> 00:13:45,550
You microwaved a bunch of my dad's records.
你把我爸的一堆唱片拿去微波

236
00:13:47,120 --> 00:13:48,780
Why?
為什麼？

237
00:13:48,960 --> 00:13:53,480
Evidently,you weren't very good at handling your high.
顯然你一high就會很失控

238
00:14:01,600 --> 00:14:05,470
Dad, please don't pick your teeth out here.
爸，請別在這裡剔牙

239
00:14:05,710 --> 00:14:07,610
And if you're gonna put your feet up..
如果你要翹腳，怎麼不坐…

240
00:14:07,880 --> 00:14:09,370
Leave him alone!
摩妮卡，不要煩他

241
00:14:11,780 --> 00:14:13,040
Will you hurry up?
你快點好嗎？

242
00:14:13,280 --> 00:14:17,220
Did you not hear me when I told you that Janine's friends are dancers?
你之前沒聽到我說 吉寧的朋友都是舞者嗎？

243
00:14:17,450 --> 00:14:20,320
And that they're gonna be drinking a lot?
而且她們會喝很多酒？

244
00:14:20,890 --> 00:14:24,980
No,I did. But tell me again because it's so romantic.
我是聽到了，不過你再說一次 好浪漫喔

245
00:14:25,490 --> 00:14:27,790
You're whipping so slow. Do it faster!
你打得好慢，不能快一點嗎？

246
00:14:28,060 --> 00:14:30,120
I don't want to make any mistakes!
喬伊，我不想犯錯 

247
00:14:30,330 --> 00:14:33,300
If I screw it up, everybody's gonna be like:
甜點只有這一道，要是我搞砸

248
00:14:33,500 --> 00:14:37,630
"Oh,remember that Thanksgiving when Rachel screwed up the trifle?"
大家會說「記得那次感恩節」 「瑞秋把酒果醬鬆糕做壞了」

249
00:14:39,670 --> 00:14:43,470
Just let me worry about making it, and you just worry about eating it.
所以做讓我來做 你只管擔心吃的部分

250
00:14:43,780 --> 00:14:45,140
Oh,I am.
我是很擔心

251
00:14:46,810 --> 00:14:50,770
-If you don't tell them, then I will. -Okay. Fine.
羅斯，你再不說，我就要說了 好啦

252
00:14:51,490 --> 00:14:54,110
Ross, can I talk to you for a second?
羅斯，你可以來一下嗎？

253
00:14:54,590 --> 00:14:57,150
Can it wait? I have to tell my parents something.
等一下好嗎？ 我有事要告訴我爸嗎

254
00:14:57,360 --> 00:14:58,850
No,it can't? Okay.
不能等？好吧

255
00:15:04,330 --> 00:15:07,160
We have to tell Rachel she messed up her dessert.
我覺得我們應該告訴瑞秋 她做錯了

256
00:15:07,370 --> 00:15:09,600
What? What is with everybody?
什麼？大家是都怎麼了？

257
00:15:09,840 --> 00:15:11,460
It's Thanksgiving,not...
今天是感恩節，不是...

258
00:15:11,770 --> 00:15:13,760
Truth Day!
告解日

259
00:15:14,340 --> 00:15:18,140
Look,when everyone eats that banana-meat thing...
等大家吃到那道香蕉肉甜點

260
00:15:18,350 --> 00:15:20,910
they'll all make fun of her. Do you want that?
一定會取笑她，那樣你也好嗎

261
00:15:21,180 --> 00:15:24,550
We'll just get everyone to act like they like it.
好，我們就叫大家假裝喜歡

262
00:15:24,790 --> 00:15:26,750
That way,no one makes fun of her...
那樣就不會有人取笑她 

263
00:15:26,950 --> 00:15:30,250
and we still get to go to sweet-potato pie.
我們也可以去找那些小辣椒

264
00:15:31,390 --> 00:15:33,290
Dude,they're not objects.
別把她們物化

265
00:15:35,300 --> 00:15:37,920
Just kidding. I'll talk to them. You distract her.
開玩笑的，我去告訴大家 你把瑞秋拖開

266
00:15:39,330 --> 00:15:42,860
Hey,Rach,can I talk to you outside for a sec?
瑞秋，可以出去談一下嗎？

267
00:15:44,710 --> 00:15:46,000
Okay.
好吧

268
00:15:52,550 --> 00:15:54,140
What's up,Ross?
什麼事？

269
00:15:54,850 --> 00:15:56,040
So....
所以…

270
00:15:57,150 --> 00:15:58,950
Thanksgiving.
感恩節

271
00:16:00,690 --> 00:16:04,280
The holiday season is upon us.
歲末季節又來了

272
00:16:07,530 --> 00:16:08,960
And...
是啊

274
00:16:10,230 --> 00:16:12,360
you look nice today.
還有…你今天很漂亮

275
00:16:12,800 --> 00:16:15,890
-Oh,no. No, Ross, don't do this. -What?
不，羅斯，不要這樣 什麼？

276
00:16:16,170 --> 00:16:20,500
I don't think us getting back together is a good idea.
我覺得我們不適合復合

277
00:16:24,010 --> 00:16:25,910
I thought this might happen today.
我早就料到會這樣

278
00:16:26,150 --> 00:16:28,340
I know the holidays can be rough...
我知道逢年過節特別難熬

279
00:16:28,580 --> 00:16:31,750
and it's probably hard for you to be alone right now.
而且你一個人八成很辛苦

280
00:16:31,990 --> 00:16:33,080
You're alone.
你也是一個人

281
00:16:34,250 --> 00:16:36,250
No,I live with Phoebe.
不，我跟菲比住 

282
00:16:36,490 --> 00:16:39,430
I mean,you're alone-alone.
你就真的只有一個人

283
00:16:40,260 --> 00:16:44,290
And it's just not the time for us. I'm sorry.
但這個時機真的不對，抱歉

284
00:16:45,070 --> 00:16:47,800
Oh,well. Can't blame a guy for trying.
我總得試試看

285
00:16:52,470 --> 00:16:55,030
And if anyone needs help pretending to like it...
要是有人不知道怎麼裝

286
00:16:55,280 --> 00:16:59,270
I learned some things in acting class. Try rubbing your stomach.
我在表演課學過 你們可以摸摸肚子

287
00:17:00,880 --> 00:17:03,440
Or saying, "Mmm."
或是說「嗯…」

288
00:17:03,880 --> 00:17:05,940
Smiling.
還有微笑

289
00:17:07,790 --> 00:17:10,950
I'm not gonna pay for those acting classes anymore.
我再也不花錢讓你去上表演課

290
00:17:13,090 --> 00:17:16,150
Rachel,there you are. Let's serve that dessert already!
瑞秋，你回來了，快上甜點吧

291
00:17:16,430 --> 00:17:20,560
Joey, you have to stop rushing me. You don't get any dessert.
喬伊，別再催我了 你知道嗎？罰你不准吃

293
00:17:20,800 --> 00:17:21,890
Really?
是喔？

294
00:17:23,270 --> 00:17:26,400
No,just kidding. I would never do that to you.
騙你的，我才不會虐待你

295
00:17:26,640 --> 00:17:29,440
Okay, everybody, it's trifle time.
好，各位，酒果醬鬆糕時間到

296
00:17:29,680 --> 00:17:33,310
So,Rach,this is a traditional English trifle,isn't it?
這是英式酒果醬鬆糕對吧？

297
00:17:33,650 --> 00:17:34,940
-It sure is. -Wow.
一點也沒錯

298
00:17:35,150 --> 00:17:37,280
So did you make it with beef or eggplant?
那你是加牛肉還是茄子？ 

299
00:17:37,620 --> 00:17:41,050
-Beef. -I can't have any. I don't eat meat.
牛肉 我不能吃 你也知道我不吃肉

300
00:17:44,930 --> 00:17:47,860
Monica, I want you to have the first taste.
摩妮卡，我要你第一個品嚐

301
00:17:48,230 --> 00:17:49,460
Really?
是嗎？

302
00:17:53,000 --> 00:17:54,630
Wait, you only got whipped cream.
等等，你只挖了鮮奶油 

303
00:17:54,900 --> 00:17:57,030
You gotta take a bite with all the layers.
你得挖到每一層

304
00:17:59,645 --> 00:18:00,737
好

305
00:18:01,740 --> 00:18:02,870
You dropped a pea.
等等，你掉了一顆豌豆

306
00:18:12,790 --> 00:18:13,780
Well?
怎麼樣？

307
00:18:14,960 --> 00:18:17,690
嗯…

308
00:18:23,430 --> 00:18:24,920
It's good.
好好吃

309
00:18:25,700 --> 00:18:27,060
Really? How good?
真的嗎？多好吃？

310
00:18:27,300 --> 00:18:29,290
It's so good that I feel selfish...
好吃到...

311
00:18:29,500 --> 00:18:31,800
about being the only one who's eating it.
我一個人吃會過意不去

312
00:18:32,010 --> 00:18:35,500
I think we should have everyone taste how good it is.
我們應該讓每個人都享用

313
00:18:35,810 --> 00:18:37,830
Especially Ross.
尤其是羅斯

314
00:18:44,650 --> 00:18:48,280
This is so good that I'm gonna go enjoy it on the balcony.
真是太好吃了，我要去陽台吃

315
00:18:50,360 --> 00:18:54,420
So that I can enjoy the view whilst I enjoy my dessert.
好邊看風景邊享用

316
00:18:56,030 --> 00:18:57,660
I've gotta call my friend...
我要去房裡打電話 

317
00:18:57,930 --> 00:19:00,530
and tell her how good this is from Monica's room.
告訴我的朋友瑪麗有多好吃

318
00:19:00,800 --> 00:19:02,100
I'll help dial.
我幫你撥號

319
00:19:04,810 --> 00:19:06,640
I'm gonna go into the bathroom...
我要去浴室

320
00:19:06,870 --> 00:19:09,840
so I can look at it in the mirror as I eat it.
好邊吃邊照鏡子

321
00:19:12,050 --> 00:19:14,780
What was that all about? Does it not taste good?
這是怎麼回事？不好吃嗎？ 

322
00:19:14,980 --> 00:19:17,210
-Let me try it. -No,no!
我吃吃看 什麼？不行

323
00:19:22,320 --> 00:19:23,950
All gone!
都沒了

324
00:19:25,990 --> 00:19:27,650
So good.
好好吃

325
00:19:28,200 --> 00:19:30,990
Maybe Chandler has some left.
也許錢德還有剩

326
00:19:33,730 --> 00:19:35,790
It tastes like feet.
味道好像洗腳水

327
00:19:38,170 --> 00:19:39,540
I like it!
我喜歡

328
00:19:43,140 --> 00:19:44,170
Are you kidding?
不是吧？

329
00:19:44,680 --> 00:19:46,980
What's not to like? Custard, good.
有什麼不好？乳蛋糕？贊

330
00:19:47,210 --> 00:19:50,380
Jam,good. Meat,good.
果醬？贊，牛肉？贊

331
00:19:52,750 --> 00:19:56,210
So a bird just grabbed it...
一隻鳥就這樣一把搶過去…

332
00:19:58,560 --> 00:20:01,690
and then tried to fly away with it...
想帶著它飛走

333
00:20:02,160 --> 00:20:04,430
and then just dropped it on the street?
結果就掉到馬路上了？

334
00:20:06,230 --> 00:20:08,930
If it's any consolation, before the bird dropped it...
對，不過值得安慰的是 掉下去之前...

335
00:20:09,140 --> 00:20:11,230
he seemed to enjoy it.
它好像吃得很開心

336
00:20:13,110 --> 00:20:14,160
Rachel,come here.
瑞秋，來一下

337
00:20:16,340 --> 00:20:19,870
I was taking my Thanksgiving nap and I had another dream.
我剛剛小睡一覺，又夢到傑克

338
00:20:20,080 --> 00:20:23,110
-Do I want to hear this? -I don't know,let's see.
菲比，我會想聽嗎？ 我不知道，你聽聽看

340
00:20:24,590 --> 00:20:26,520
I dreamt we were getting married...
我夢到我們正要結婚 

341
00:20:26,750 --> 00:20:29,590
and he left because he had to go fight a fire.
結果他離開去救火

342
00:20:29,790 --> 00:20:33,350
So I went to a nightclub and I saw him making out with a girl.
所以我去一家夜總會 卻看到他跟一個女的在親熱

343
00:20:33,590 --> 00:20:36,430
Oh, my God, he dream-cheated on you!
天哪，他在夢裡背叛你

344
00:20:36,960 --> 00:20:38,760
But then Jacques Cousteau came...
對，但這時賈克庫斯托出現 

345
00:20:38,970 --> 00:20:41,370
and he kicked his ass for betraying me.
幫我教訓了他一頓

346
00:20:41,570 --> 00:20:43,200
So cool!
好酷喔

347
00:20:43,440 --> 00:20:46,740
Then he took me diving and introduced me to his sea horse...
然後他帶我去潛水 跟我介紹他養的海馬

348
00:20:46,970 --> 00:20:51,410
who was coming on to me. Please, that is not gonna happen.
它一直對我獻慇勤 但是怎麼可能

349
00:20:54,050 --> 00:20:57,280
Boy,I'm glad I wore the big belt today.
幸好我今天繫了大皮帶

350
00:20:59,290 --> 00:21:02,740
Five minutes ago,a line like that would have floored me.
5分鐘前 那種話會讓我神魂顛倒

351
00:21:03,220 --> 00:21:06,950
But now,nothing. Well,not nothing. I am still a woman.
現在卻毫無作用… 一點點啦，我畢竟是女人

353
00:21:10,330 --> 00:21:12,300
Ross? Let's go.
羅斯，來吧

354
00:21:12,770 --> 00:21:15,060
Oh,yeah. About telling Mom and Dad...
關於告訴他們這件事 

355
00:21:15,300 --> 00:21:18,100
I was thinking about maybe writing a letter.
我考慮用寫信的

356
00:21:18,310 --> 00:21:20,500
That's it. You've had your chance.
夠了，我給過你機會

357
00:21:20,646 --> 00:21:21,638
What?
什麼？

358
00:21:22,240 --> 00:21:26,010
Mom,Dad. Ross smoked pot in college.
媽，爸，羅斯大學哈過麻

359
00:21:26,485 --> 00:21:27,877
What?
什麼？

360
00:21:28,120 --> 00:21:30,480
You are such a tattletale!
你這個抓耙仔

361
00:21:33,150 --> 00:21:34,850
Mom,Dad...
媽 爸

362
00:21:35,860 --> 00:21:38,830
you remember that time you walked in my room...
記得你們在我房裡

363
00:21:39,090 --> 00:21:40,820
and smelled marijuana?
聞到大麻的事嗎？

364
00:21:41,030 --> 00:21:42,000
Yes.
記得

365
00:21:46,600 --> 00:21:48,430
I told you it was Chandler...
我說是錢德

366
00:21:48,700 --> 00:21:52,040
who was smoking the pot but...
在哈麻 其實…

367
00:21:53,840 --> 00:21:56,310
it was me. I'm sorry.
是我，對不起

368
00:21:56,610 --> 00:21:57,630
It was you?
是你？

369
00:21:58,410 --> 00:22:01,380
And Dad, Chandler didn't melt your records.
爸，錢德沒把你的唱片燒壞

370
00:22:01,850 --> 00:22:03,610
Ross did.
是羅斯干的

371
00:22:04,850 --> 00:22:06,340
-Is that true? -And Dad...
是真的嗎？ 還有

372
00:22:06,520 --> 00:22:08,610
you know that mailman that you got fired?
你害他被革職的郵差

373
00:22:08,790 --> 00:22:12,730
He didn't steal your Playboys. Ross did.
他沒有偷你的花花公子 是羅斯偷的

374
00:22:17,230 --> 00:22:21,130
Well, Hurricane Gloria didn't break the porch swing. Monica did!
前廊的鞦韆椅不是風雨弄壞的 是摩妮卡坐壞的

375
00:22:23,870 --> 00:22:26,400
Ross hasn't worked at the museum for a year!
羅斯已經離開博物館1年了

376
00:22:27,910 --> 00:22:30,740
Monica and Chandler are living together!
摩妮卡和錢德在同居

377
00:22:33,750 --> 00:22:37,770
Ross married Rachel in Vegas! And got divorced! Again!
羅斯在賭城娶了瑞秋 然後又離婚了！

378
00:22:39,690 --> 00:22:41,620
I love Jacques Cousteau!
我愛賈克庫斯托

379
00:22:44,420 --> 00:22:48,450
I wasn't supposed to put beef in the trifle!
酒果醬鬆糕裡不該放牛肉的

380
00:22:48,930 --> 00:22:51,400
I want to go!
我想走啦~~

381
00:22:54,200 --> 00:22:58,540
That's a lot of information to get in 30 seconds.
這30秒真是高潮不斷啊

382
00:22:59,610 --> 00:23:02,940
All right. Joey, if you want to leave, just leave.
好，喬伊，你想走就走吧

383
00:23:04,710 --> 00:23:08,940
Rachel, no, you weren't supposed to put beef in the trifle.
瑞秋，這道甜點的確不能放肉

384
00:23:09,220 --> 00:23:11,150
It did not taste good.
一點也不好吃

385
00:23:13,620 --> 00:23:15,680
Phoebe,I'm sorry...
菲比，很抱歉 

386
00:23:15,890 --> 00:23:19,120
but I think Jacques Cousteau is dead.
賈克庫斯托已經死了

387
00:23:20,360 --> 00:23:23,730
Monica, why you felt you had to hide the fact...
摩妮卡，我真不懂 你為何要隱瞞...

388
00:23:23,900 --> 00:23:26,660
that you're in an important relationship is beyond me.
一段重要的感情

389
00:23:26,970 --> 00:23:29,800
And we kind of figured about the porch swing.
其實鞦韆椅的事我們心裡有數

390
00:23:31,870 --> 00:23:33,000
Ross.
羅斯

391
00:23:33,210 --> 00:23:34,330
Drugs?
嗑藥？

392
00:23:34,610 --> 00:23:36,580
Divorced again?
三度離婚？

393
00:23:38,210 --> 00:23:39,540
What happened,son?
你是怎麼了？

394
00:23:41,010 --> 00:23:44,710
I got tricked into all those things.
我都是遭人哄騙

395
00:23:46,220 --> 00:23:50,950
Chandler, you've been Ross' best friend all these years...
錢德，你一直是羅斯的好朋友

396
00:23:51,220 --> 00:23:54,020
stuck by him during the drug problems...
在他嗑藥時仍不放棄他

397
00:23:56,300 --> 00:23:59,130
and now you've taken on Monica as well.
現在你又照顧起摩妮卡

398
00:23:59,400 --> 00:24:02,630
Well,I don't know what to say.
我不知道該說什麼 

399
00:24:02,870 --> 00:24:04,730
You're a wonderful human being.
你真是個大好人

400
00:24:07,470 --> 00:24:09,310
-Thank you! -No.
謝謝你 不

401
00:24:09,580 --> 00:24:11,370
Thank you!
是謝謝你

402
00:24:12,950 --> 00:24:17,650
Monica and Ross, I don't know what I'm gonna do about the two of you.
摩妮卡，羅斯 我真不知道該拿你們怎麼辦

403
00:24:18,490 --> 00:24:20,610
I'll talk to them.
我會跟他們談

404
00:24:25,790 --> 00:24:27,690
You guys, it was bananas...
各位，香蕉

405
00:24:27,930 --> 00:24:30,290
cream and beef!
奶油加牛肉耶

406
00:24:31,130 --> 00:24:35,000
I just cannot believe that you ate that so that I wouldn't feel bad.
你們居然因為怕我難過而吃掉

407
00:24:35,200 --> 00:24:38,470
Well, actually, I didn't eat mine. It's still in the bathroom.
其實我沒吃，還放在浴室裡

408
00:24:38,670 --> 00:24:39,660
No, I ate that.
沒有，我吃掉了

409
00:24:42,480 --> 00:24:44,500
And we left ours in Monica's bedroom.
我們的在摩妮卡的房裡

410
00:24:44,710 --> 00:24:47,010
Nope, got it and got yours too.
沒有，被我吃了，你的也是

411
00:24:49,020 --> 00:24:51,510
Chandler, are you gonna stick with that bird story?
錢德 你還要死守你的鳥故事嗎？

412
00:24:51,690 --> 00:24:54,090
It was a big bird. Swooped right in there.
那隻鳥很大，神准的衝過來

413
00:24:56,420 --> 00:24:58,220
-Hi. -Oh,Janine.
吉寧

414
00:24:58,390 --> 00:25:00,590
-It's not over,is it? -Yeah.
聚會還沒結束吧？ 結束了 

415
00:25:00,760 --> 00:25:04,030
We all got depressed. The holidays and everything, we're alone.
節日讓我們感到更孤單

416
00:25:04,200 --> 00:25:05,960
Yeah,well,at least you have Joey.
至少你有喬伊 

417
00:25:06,130 --> 00:25:09,260
But Ross is really alone.
羅斯就真的是一個人

418
00:25:10,640 --> 00:25:12,660
Well, you're always welcome here.
這裡永遠歡迎你

419
00:25:12,840 --> 00:25:14,200
This is my mom and my dad.
這是我媽和我爸 

420
00:25:14,370 --> 00:25:16,070
-This is Janine. -Nice to meet you.
這位是吉寧 幸會…

421
00:25:16,240 --> 00:25:18,970
-I think we've already met. -Really?
我們已經見過了 是嗎？ 

422
00:25:19,150 --> 00:25:23,010
I live across the hall. You walked in on me when I was changing.
我住在對面 你在我換衣服時闖進來

423
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


424
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000
